        {
          "panel": "N2-02",
          "text": "Yes. Please.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-03",
          "text": "Would you help me get these received?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-03",
          "text": "Show me the receipt.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-04",
          "text": "A reply to Lower District?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-05",
          "text": "I cannot register a return against a closed route. There is no inspected entrance on file.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-06",
          "text": "I was paid there this morning. That signature belongs to a person.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-07",
          "text": "The payment stands. For an office return, I need a current door register and an inspected route.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-08",
          "text": "I filed these. This time I will walk it, with the residents.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-09",
          "text": "Bring it back before this desk closes. I will keep the case open.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-10",
          "text": "Names first. Then the doors they actually use.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-11",
          "text": "Hessa moved down one landing.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-11",
          "text": "Then that is where the post goes.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-12",
          "text": "I will keep this latch clear. Start here. Come back here.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-13",
          "text": "This inspection is work. You will be paid for the round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-14",
          "text": "All right. Stairs first.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-15",
          "text": "You will not have to jump the railing again.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
